{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:10.60.200","page_type":"section"},"citation":"10.60.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.200","content_hash":"64844ae60ef6085197dc5746c48fedca25996a35196c5ef274a6ff62a2469877","heading":"Time-restricted parking rates – Parking meters.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.200:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.200","text":"(a) The Transportation Operations Superintendent may establish parking rates in time-restricted parking zones where payment is required within the following minimum and maximum ranges:\n(1) On street: $0.50 and $3.00 per hour.\n(2) Ten-hour permits: $44.00 and $120.00 per month.\n(b) In determining the parking rates, the Transportation Operations Superintendent will consider the availability of on-street parking, garage and lot parking, parking congestion and any other factors relative to parking operations in the central business district. (Ord. 20566 § 7, 6-10-25.)\nCross References: Transportation Operations Division, TMC 10.10.060 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"7749a05f-b163-549c-916b-32ece5e3e09c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.200","content_hash":"f2b3aebf9d28ade1dba23dfabf8e09c8b54cf6e6c94b4fc579e72b5a21f495fa","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.200:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.200:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.200","text":"(a) The Transportation Operations Superintendent may establish parking rates in time-r